# C++-level GC coordination self-test (SimpleMarkSweepGC::
# runCoordinationSelfTest): hammers RT yield sections vs requestCollect
# (incl. the deferred-wake path), persistent + nested ExternalParticipants,
# GCSafeBlockScope, and interned-string churn from concurrent threads, then
# asserts collections ran with zero section-collector violations and all
# counters returned to rest.  The verdict prints on stdout; the counter
# summary prints on stderr and is shape-checked by gc_selftest.err.
_runtests('gc_coordination')
